<title>USA: Maxxon to acquire N.J. catheter maker.</title>
<headline>Maxxon to acquire N.J. catheter maker.</headline>
<dateline>TULSA, Okla. 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Maxxon Inc said Tuesday it signed a letter of intent to acquire Fluidics Inc, a New Jersey-based catheter maker, for $6 million in restricted Maxxon stock.</p>
<p>The acquisition will be accounted for as a purchase and a definitive agreement is expected to be completed within 90 days, said Maxxon, a medical products concern.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
